# What never goes into an image.
#
# Secrets first: an .env baked into an image travels with every copy of it,
# to every registry it is pushed to. Production settings come from the
# environment the container runs in, never from the build context.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Rebuilt inside the image, from the lockfile, for the image's own platform.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.expo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Large, local, or both.
.git
apps/mobile/android
apps/mobile/ios
test-results
site-screenshots-*
*.png
!apps/web/public/**/*.png
